{"4819940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blackfall: Cyborgs Down", "steam_appid": 4819940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WELCOME TO THE BLACKFALL ZONE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted by a solo indie developer, Blackfall: Cyborgs Down is a high-octane, third-person sci-fi looter shooter packed with deep RPG progression, set on a war-torn technological island where biomechanical heroes known as the Valor Cyborgs fight for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock and load into an explosive, living world built for endless replayability, massive build variety, and countless hours of high-stakes action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Tactical &amp; High-Intensity Combat: Experience fast, purposeful firefights with tight gunplay, an aggressive pacing rhythm, and powerful weapon talents that shape every real-time encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 19 Valor Cyborgs Across 4 Classes: Take control of specialized heroes divided into Assault, Tank, Engineer, and Assassin classes. Deeply customize your build with over 26 passive, 30 tactical, and 12 ultimate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Massive Arsenal &amp; Advanced Crafting: Master over 59 weapon models featuring 177 unique variants and game-changing talents, fully integrated with a deep resource gathering and upgrade system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 67-Node Mastery System: Navigate a massive progression skill tree engineered specifically for ultimate endgame optimization, allowing you to forge highly specialized hybrid character builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Turn-Based 'Prime Battle' Mode: Discover and awaken energy cores across the island to trigger a secondary, turn-based tactical strategy mode with up to 6v6 combat. Collect, manage, and upgrade 51 legendary heavy combat mechs with mechanics reminiscent of classic creature-collection games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Expansive High-Stakes Campaign: Deploy into the dangerous Blackfall Zone and conquer 9 main missions, 25 side missions, 6 challenging &quot;Valor Trials,&quot; and 9 intense endgame operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build. Collect your army. Survive the storm. Step into Blackfall and prove you are the ultimate weapon.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WELCOME TO THE BLACKFALL ZONE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted by a solo indie developer, Blackfall: Cyborgs Down is a high-octane, third-person sci-fi looter shooter packed with deep RPG progression, set on a war-torn technological island where biomechanical heroes known as the Valor Cyborgs fight for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock and load into an explosive, living world built for endless replayability, massive build variety, and countless hours of high-stakes action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Tactical &amp; High-Intensity Combat: Experience fast, purposeful firefights with tight gunplay, an aggressive pacing rhythm, and powerful weapon talents that shape every real-time encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 19 Valor Cyborgs Across 4 Classes: Take control of specialized heroes divided into Assault, Tank, Engineer, and Assassin classes. Deeply customize your build with over 26 passive, 30 tactical, and 12 ultimate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Massive Arsenal &amp; Advanced Crafting: Master over 59 weapon models featuring 177 unique variants and game-changing talents, fully integrated with a deep resource gathering and upgrade system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* 67-Node Mastery System: Navigate a massive progression skill tree engineered specifically for ultimate endgame optimization, allowing you to forge highly specialized hybrid character builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Turn-Based 'Prime Battle' Mode: Discover and awaken energy cores across the island to trigger a secondary, turn-based tactical strategy mode with up to 6v6 combat. Collect, manage, and upgrade 51 legendary heavy combat mechs with mechanics reminiscent of classic creature-collection games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Expansive High-Stakes Campaign: Deploy into the dangerous Blackfall Zone and conquer 9 main missions, 25 side missions, 6 challenging &quot;Valor Trials,&quot; and 9 intense endgame operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build. Collect your army. Survive the storm. Step into Blackfall and prove you are the ultimate weapon.</p>", "short_description": "Deploy to a war-torn sci-fi island in Blackfall: Cyborgs Down, a high-intensity third-person looter shooter. Customize 18 Valor Cyborgs across 4 classes, master 60+ weapon models, and a 67-node skill tree. Then, trigger the turn-based 6v6 Prime Battle mode to collect and upgrade heavy mechs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819940/d3c42f4f785673e63f4f75ef10766d74ec16bd34/header.jpg?t=1787968028", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819940/948f12539a79245a6c5213e84ed210dcca89b4fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787968028", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819940/948f12539a79245a6c5213e84ed210dcca89b4fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787968028", "website": "https://www.legendarygamesstudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory: